WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:02.660
This is SoundX AI.

2
00:00:02.670 --> 00:00:07.410
It merges Sound Deck AI and the SoundX studio into one browser app.

3
00:00:07.420 --> 00:00:13.890
There are pads, a sequencer, a plugin rack, and song, pattern and piano views.

4
00:00:13.900 --> 00:00:16.960
The God Mode hub holds sixty cards.

5
00:00:16.970 --> 00:00:22.720
The AI Producer takes a written request, like add drums, and proposes a change.

6
00:00:22.730 --> 00:00:25.730
The session changes only when you apply it.

7
00:00:25.740 --> 00:00:29.970
It works offline, with no account and no API key.
